<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;">Inquiry received ✅</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
  Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We have successfully received your inquiry for:
  <strong>{{tourName}}</strong>.
</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%; background:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:14px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Participants:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">{{participants}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Preferred dates:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">{{startDate}} → {{endDate}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Total estimate:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">{{currency}} {{totalPrice}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;"><strong>Status:</strong></td>
    <td style="padding:6px 0;">PENDING</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0;">
  Our team will review your request and get back to you shortly.
</p>

<p style="margin:14px 0 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:13px;">
  Inquiry ID: <code>{{inquiryId}}</code>
</p>
